he given matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 1+\\text{i} & 5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2-3\\text{i} & 1-\\text{i} \\\\ 1+\\text{i} & 0+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $c=1,d=0,g=1$ and $h=5.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\ncd+gh=1\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 5=5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-76201/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3c28b8ae-71ef-5d26-895a-5d949fc5b164"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76201"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76202/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "9c74e179-97cc-54f0-9bc9-04f99a973eb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76202/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "fdcf9f28-26bc-56bb-9526-528f032feb18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76202/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "d9f280bf-1352-5c84-a459-045a68518d37" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76202/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "4a7aecd8-0458-52fd-968c-8ea72e0d1c4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76202/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "8e549982-a803-5116-8aa4-56a49aab37d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76202/selection" :answer-field/id #